{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40689","headline":"和知己赴任华州 · 李洞","name":"和知己赴任华州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东门罢相郡，此拜动京华。\n落日开宵印，初灯见早麻。\n鹤身红斾拂，仙掌白云遮。\n塞色侵三县，河声聒两衙。\n松根醒客酒，莲座隐僧家。\n一道帆飞直，中筵岳影斜。\n书名寻雪石，澄鼎露金沙。\n锁合眠关吏，杯寒啄庙鸦。\n分台话嵩洛，赛雨恋烟霞。\n树谷期招隐，吟诗煮栢茶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}